  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たすけを　もとめる　なかまの　こえを　きくとすがたを　かえる。その　しゅんかんは　だれにも　みせない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "도움을 구하는 동료의 소리를 들으면 모습을 바꾼다. 그 순간은 누구에게도 보여 주지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要聽見夥伴求助的聲音，就會改變自己的樣子。那瞬間絕不會讓誰看見。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il change de forme dès qu’il entend les cris de détresse de ses congénères, mais il ne laissera jamais personne assister à sa transformation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hört es die Hilferufe von Artgenossen, ändert es seine Form. Den Moment seiner Verwandlung zeigt es jedoch niemandem.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cambia de forma en cuanto recibe una señal de socorro de sus compañeros. Nunca se transforma delante de nadie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cambia forma non appena sente i suoi compagni chiamare aiuto, assicurandosi di non essere mai visto da nessuno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon changes its appearance if it hears its allies calling for help. Palafin will never show anybody its moment of transformation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "助けを　求める　仲間の　声を　聞くと姿を　変える。その　瞬間は　だれにも　見せない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要听见伙伴求助的声音，它就会改变自己的样子。那瞬间绝不会让谁看见。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cambia de forma en cuanto recibe una señal de socorro de sus compañeros. Nunca se transforma delante de nadie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0004\t身体能力しんたいのうりょく身体能力は　ナミイルカとかわらないが　なかまの　ピンチにはへんしんして　パワーアップするぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "신체 능력은 맨돌핀과 차이가 없지만, 동료가 위기에 처하면 변신해서 파워업한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "體能與波普海豚不相上下，但一旦夥伴陷入了危機，就會變身來提高自己的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a les mêmes capacités physiques qu’avant son évolution, mais quand ses congénères sont en danger, il change de forme et devient plus fort.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine körperliche Kraft unterscheidet sich nicht von Normifin. Ist jedoch ein Artgenosse in Not, verwandelt es sich und wird viel stärker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee la misma fortaleza física que un Finizen, pero, cuando se transforma para ayudar a un compañero en apuros, se vuelve más fuerte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha la stessa forza fisica di Finizen, ma quando un suo compagno si trova in difficoltà, si trasforma e la sua potenza aumenta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its physical capabilities are no different than a Finizen’s, but when its allies are in danger, it transforms and powers itself up.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0004\t身体能力しんたいのうりょく身体能力は　ナミイルカと変わらないが　仲間の　ピンチには変身して　パワーアップするぞ。",
      "language": {
